{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"ec453b6355ccd094ad1e9de83a222b985ce4cd80d102d4a0deed60e8f6d022d1","digest":{"component_or_area":"MCP server attested-source gates and snapshot layer","key_entities":["review_plan","verify_completion","review_code","scan_spec","reconcile","attach_commits","/app","/var/gerrit/site/mcp-code","REBAR_ROOT","MCP_CODE_DIR",".dockerignore","Dockerfile.mcp","_snapshot/repo_snapshot.py","gate_source.resolve_gate_handle","_config_resolvers.repo_root_or_none","llm/gate_source.py"],"problem_keywords":["attested-source LLM gates","git ref resolution","missing repository metadata","container deployment","ref-resolution failure","missing .git directory"],"propositions":["Every attested-source LLM gate operation (review_plan, verify_completion, review_code, scan_spec, reconcile, attach_commits) fails on the deployed MCP server because the container root /app has no .git metadata or git object database.","The snapshot layer in repo_snapshot.py falls back to hardcoded '.' (process cwd) when no explicit repo_root is passed, ignoring the configured REBAR_ROOT environment variable and preventing ref resolution even when a valid repository exists elsewhere.","The MCP server container is provisioned with a blobless code clone at /var/gerrit/site/mcp-code that successfully resolves origin/main and other refs, but gate operations never consult it due to the snapshot layer's hardcoded cwd default.","The gate_source layer must apply the configured repo_root default (via repo_root_or_none) to ensure snapshot operations resolve refs against the provisioned code repository rather than an empty application directory.","No task/story/epic can be closed through the live MCP server when plan-review attestation is required, because review_plan cannot execute successfully and unsigned verdicts from source=local cannot satisfy the gate."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787863626319643001,"uuid":"f023ed93-5dfd-461b-a42c-17dd63bf2f38"}